//! The `rule` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)
//! [shorthand](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Cascade/Shorthand_properties)
//! property sets the width, style, and color of the line drawn between rows and columns in multi-row
//! grid, flex, and multi-col layouts, setting both the column and row rules to the same values.
//!
//! Grammar: <'column-rule'>
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-gaps-1/#propdef-rule
//!
